  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1256",
    "issue_date": "2026-07-23T02:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-23T02:33:45.175Z",
    "meteorologist": "Rojan Lamichhane",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशभर मनसुनी वायूको प्रभाव रहेको छ। हाल मनसुनको न्यून चापीय रेखा सरदर स्थानमा रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "Monsoon winds are currently affecting the entire country. At present, the monsoon trough lies close to its climatological (average) position.",
    "today_np": "देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भूभागमा  साधारणतया बादल लाग्ने र तराई भूभागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका तराईका थोरै स्थान तथा मधेश प्रदेश र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराईको एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र कर्णाली प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions, while the Terai region will remain partly cloudy. There is a possibility of light to moderate rain/thundershowers at some places of the Hilly and Himalayan regions. There is also a possibility of light to moderate rain with thunder and lightning at a few places of the Terai region of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Lumbini Provinces, and at one or two places of the Terai region of Madhesh and Sudurpashchim Provinces. There is a possibility of heavy rainfall at one or two places of the Hilly region of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Karnali Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भूभागमा  साधारणतया बादल लाग्ने र तराई भूभागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थान तथा मधेश र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका एक दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। कोशी र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions, while the Terai region will remain partly cloudy. There is a possibility of light to moderate rain/thundershowers at a few places of the Hilly and Himalayan regions. There is also a possibility of light to moderate rain with thunder and lightning at a few places of the Terai region of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Lumbini Provinces, and at one or two places of the Terai region of Madhesh and Sudurpashchim Provinces. There is a possibility of heavy rainfall at one or two places of the Himalayan region of Koshi and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
